ve the base high of $68.93. Volume that day was 16.8M shares, 2.55x the prior 10-day average of 6.6M. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $84.77, and the chart ends at $82.94.","lesson":"This is an example of a textbook breakout: a base, then a close above it on heavy volume, and it held. This is the pattern the rules are built around."}}